sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API
    participant R as Redis

    C->>A: Request
    A->>R: INCR ratelimit key
    alt count == 1
        A->>R: EXPIRE key 60s
    end
    alt count <= limit
        A-->>C: 200 OK
    else count > limit
        A-->>C: 429 Too Many Requests
    end
